      { num: '04', name: 'Pediatric Care-Pathway Module', desc: 'Confirmed positives routed to specialist referral with treatment timelines and follow-up tracking. Target: 100% of confirmed cases in a pathway within 14 days.' },
      { num: '05', name: 'FHIR Integration Layer', desc: 'Results and pathway records exposed on FHIR, interoperable with Malaffi and maternity/paediatric EMRs. Consumes the DoH / Emirati Genome Programme WGS pipeline (Parabricks-accelerated) — it does not re-do sequencing.' }
