    realImpact: 'A treatable condition caught in the first weeks of life instead of after irreversible damage — for a newborn who screens positive, the difference between a managed life and a disabled or lost one. Treatment started before symptoms, not after.',
    lesson: 'The hard problem is not sequencing — it is making an 815-condition genomic result actionable inside a 10-minute paediatric consult. Triage and care pathways are where the product earns its place.'
